mments":0,"created_at":"2021-12-17T04:52:17Z","updated_at":"2021-12-21T02:59:07Z","closed_at":"2021-12-21T02:59:04Z","assignee":{"login":"adalton","id":751263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MTI2Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/751263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adalton","html_url":"https://github.com/adalton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adalton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adalton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adalton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adalton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adalton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adalton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adalton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adalton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adalton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adalton/teleport-exercise/pulls/2","html_url":"https://github.com/adalton/teleport-exercise/pull/2","diff_url":"https://github.com/adalton/teleport-exercise/pull/2.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/adalton/teleport-exercise/pull/2.patch","merged_at":"2021-12-21T02:59:04Z"},"body":"This change implements the JobManager gRPC API.\r\n\r\nThe API definition file is at `./service/jobmanager/jobmanagerv1/jobmanager.proto`.  The server implementation is at `./server/jobmanager/serverv1/jobmanager_server.go`.  The command is at `./cmd/server/server.go`; the default build target will generate `build/jobmanager`.\r\n\r\nThere are unit tests for the job manager that use the existing mock job in `./server/jobmanager/serverv1/jobmanager_server_test.go`.\r\n\r\nThere are a number of certificates in the `certs` dir with which to experiment.  There are some integration tests in `test/server/server_test.go` that use some of those certs to verify expected behavior.  The `README.md` has a more detailed description of the files in the `certs` directory.\r\n\r\nThere is a quick-n-dirty client application in `./cmd/client/client.go` that gets compiled to `build/jobctl`.  Please note that this is **not** intended to be the real client submission.  It's only a minimally functional application to enable me to exercise the server API.  It does no error checking (intentionally).  The \"real\" CLI implementation will come in a future PR.","closed_by":{"login":"adalton","id":751263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MTI2Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/751263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adalton","html_url":"https://github.com/adalton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adalton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adalton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adalton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adalton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adalton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adalton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adalton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adalton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adalton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adalton/teleport-exercise/issues/2/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adalton/teleport-exercise/issues/2/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adalton/teleport-exercise/issues/1","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adalton/tel